                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1778963e-e798-4466-962a-7f41bca50a84",
                                "sense_id": "c16e2f30-f6bc-3cdb-bd54-9827f1077195",
                                "text": "Я бро́сился бы́ло к нему́ на по́мощь: не́сколько дю́жих казако́в схвати́ли меня́ и связа́ли кушака́ми, пригова́ривая: «Вот ужо́ вам бу́дет, госуда́ревым ослу́шникам!»",
                                "translation": "I was about to rush to his succour, but was seized by a few lusty Cossacks, who bound my hands with their belts, saying:\n\"Stop a bit, you will catch it by-and-by, you traitors to the emperor!\"",
                                "english": "I was about to rush to his succour, but was seized by a few lusty Cossacks, who bound my hands with their belts, saying:\n\"Stop a bit, you will catch it by-and-by, you traitors to the emperor!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
